# PLACEHOLDER — replace before publishing the first signed release.
# Generate the real keypair on the maintainer machine:
#   brew install minisign
#   minisign -G -p minisign.pub -s ~/.minisign/vaultkeepr-release.key
# then overwrite this file with the generated minisign.pub and commit it
# BEFORE running scripts/release.sh for the first time.
# (minisign.pub is a single line: base64 Ed25519 public key + comment)